      "message": "Make the badge-set hero a poster-style banner with the image as cover art\n\nThe previous compact thumbnail + side text layout looked generic and\nburied the artwork (which for game-based sets like Super Mario Bros.\nis the visual centerpiece). Render the image full-bleed at 16:9 with\nthe title and description overlaid on a dark bottom gradient when\npresent, and fall back to a clean centered text card with a 'Badge\nset' eyebrow when no image is provided.",
