        "payload": "tree c121cd8ab5531c69e1d7ccfc6a6646b886dc4b5f\nparent e914fc7f00c76539247a083f424119a950c9da11\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1778769632 -0500\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1778769632 -0500\n\nRender reaction and zap overlays on the search feed too\n\na20d40f8 routed the home, profile, follow-page, custom-tab, and\npeople-list feeds through buildFeedItems so kind 7 reactions and\nkind 9735 / 8333 zaps render as an overlay header on the target\npost. SearchPage uses useStreamPosts (a separate streaming + paging\nhook) and was missed — its render loop only had the kind 6 / 16\nrepost branch, so reactions and zaps fell through to NoteCard's\nstandalone activity-card layout, exactly the regression a20d40f8\nwas meant to fix.\n\nRun buildFeedItems / dedupeFeedItems on the rendered slice via\nuseQuery (keyed by the post-id list so it doesn't re-run on\nunrelated re-renders), pass reactedBy / zappedBy / repostEvent\nthrough to NoteCard, and key items with feedItemKey() so the same\ntarget with multiple wrappers gets distinct stable keys.\n\nRegression-of: a20d40f8\n",
